  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "All 88 units are below market rate per the city. City Council denied an appeal on March 11, 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-25-604: Sheridan Apartments, located at 320 Sheridan Drive in Menlo Park on a 2.52 acre site, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $2,507,094 in annual federal tax credits and $3,850,318 in total state tax credits and $27,704,168 of tax-exempt bond cap to finance the new construction of 88 units of housing, consisting of 87 restricted rental units and 1 unrestricted manager's unit.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001665"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Planning Commission vote on January 13, 2025 was 5-1 (Commissioner Ferrick dissenting, one absent). The district keeps ownership of the land. The article reported construction could start in December 2025 with completion and leasing in 2027.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City page: three three-story buildings, 40 ft height, about 2,217 sq ft amenity center, 27,918 sq ft open space, zoning R-3. Density bonus waivers and incentives include LEED Silver certification and dual plumbing for recycled water. Applicant: Ravenswood City School District in partnership with Alliant Communities.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQA Notice of Exemption SCH 2025010493, Class 32 infill, filed by the City of Menlo Park; applicant Alliant Communities LLC.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003099"
      ]
    }
